    "When you say \"maximize total revenue,\" do you mean net profit (total sales revenue minus total purchase cost), or literally just total sales revenue (ignoring what you pay to buy)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice between two definitions of the objective function."
}

